    <string name="settings_help_title">Own key or Cora\'s proxy?</string>
    <string name="settings_help_own_key">Your own OpenAI key: keep the address at https://api.openai.com/v1 and paste the key (it starts with sk-). OpenAI bills you directly.</string>
    <string name="settings_help_proxy">Cora\'s proxy: set the address to https://picnic.cora.earth/v1 and paste the access token Cora gave you (it starts with pk_). No OpenAI account needed.</string>
    <string name="settings_help_privacy">The key or token stays encrypted on this phone and is only sent to the address above. Text, photos and recordings go there when you ask the app to sort or read them. Item names also go there in the background, to sort them into aisles and to pick or draw their icons (you can turn drawing off above).</string>
